  session -->|binding offer · externally connectable messaging| worker
  worker <-->|one authenticated WebSocket| cp
  worker <-->|named runtime.Port| content
  content <-->|fresh per-document MessageChannel| bridge
  bridge <-->|joins the existing runtime| sdk
  sdk -->|product telemetry · its own WebSocket| ingest
